{"chapter": "groupoids-quotients", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "048D", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$j = (t, s) : R \\to U \\times_B U$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$\\phi : U \\to X$", "MATH_0007": "$B$", "MATH_0008": "$R$", "MATH_0009": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nR \\ar[r]_s \\ar[d]_t & U \\ar[d]^\\phi \\\\\nU \\ar[r]^\\phi & X\n}\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$j : R \\to U \\times_B U$", "MATH_0011": "$G$", "MATH_0012": "$U$", "MATH_0013": "$B$", "MATH_0014": "$\\phi$", "MATH_0015": "$G$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-groupoids-lemma-groupoid-from-action}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-invariant}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:786044058e29efa6e7ace3d170f4b3a35ea2a69c569e7e307e00ad4f57423455", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:90ef5a69599aed5bfcd875084d80d36e5ac6c07b73cb58fd0e9d03a25bfe3a7d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme, and let <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a pre-relation of algebraic\nspaces over <MATH_0005>. We say a morphism <MATH_0006> of algebraic spaces\nover <MATH_0007> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0008>-invariant<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if the diagram\n<MATH_0009>\nis commutative. If <MATH_0010> comes from the action\nof a group algebraic space <MATH_0011> on <MATH_0012> over <MATH_0013> as in\nGroupoids in Spaces, Lemma <REF_0001>,\nthen we say that <MATH_0014> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0015>-invariant<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:239ffb6fe6fc342e77dc7b793af06ca35908418ddc4bbd966b03c5167eb4af83", "unit_id": "tag:048E:statement"}
{"chapter": "groupoids-quotients", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "048D", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$U \\to X$", "MATH_0002": "$R$", "MATH_0003": "$s$", "MATH_0004": "$t$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:831d9a28ac4971e5cb301ae2c5232fa87bfb5b33474e267970ab7257f1f32982", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:af391ca5f1807d37ada19cea1ca8321d366b543d29c042aafd7fdbd266794f7d", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn other words, a morphism <MATH_0001> is <MATH_0002>-invariant if it equalizes\n<MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004>.  We can reformulate this in terms of associated quotient\nsheaves as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9714717021237f484c1dfbc4862fa43c7536719a967f5dc77a35dad3b56bce26", "unit_id": "tag:048D:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "groupoids-quotients", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "048D", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$j = (t, s) : R \\to U \\times_B U$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$\\phi : U \\to X$", "MATH_0007": "$R$", "MATH_0008": "$U \\to U/R \\to X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-invariant}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a105cd4d1e428c26df13391931e4ae00be81491843b7aeb353625f54694770f2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:49984e6664d199dc2bdc5b8fdc179191f409a96a1ce87a13143a81503a2b871a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme, and let <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a pre-relation of algebraic\nspaces over <MATH_0005>. A morphism of algebraic spaces <MATH_0006> is\n<MATH_0007>-invariant if and only if it factors as\n<MATH_0008>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:07d62a9c80bda868d39f0c41d890f323daf48ec2880f7ceba4a069045fbc8e9d", "unit_id": "tag:048F:statement"}
{"chapter": "groupoids-quotients", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "048D", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-groupoids-section-quotient-sheaves}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:44c91d8fea2b116075150a6c935b614d8893d2c099489c07ce55d399b10f71a4", "source_text": "This is clear from the definition of the quotient sheaf in\nGroupoids in Spaces, Section <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fd9292cdde37017ba6b3555c7040dfc632543e3f96a8e8bfaf3676fade7f18eb", "unit_id": "tag:048F:proof"}
{"chapter": "groupoids-quotients", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "048D", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$j = (t, s) : R \\to U \\times_B U$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\to X$", "MATH_0007": "$R$", "MATH_0008": "$B$", "MATH_0009": "$X' \\to X$", "MATH_0010": "$U' = X' \\times_X U$", "MATH_0011": "$R' = X' \\times_X R$", "MATH_0012": "$j' : R' \\to U' \\times_B U'$", "MATH_0013": "$j$", "MATH_0014": "$j'$", "MATH_0015": "$j$", "MATH_0016": "$j'$", "MATH_0017": "$j$", "MATH_0018": "$j'$", "MATH_0019": "$j$", "MATH_0020": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0021": "$B$", "MATH_0022": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0023": "$X$", "MATH_0024": "$j'$", "MATH_0025": "$(U', R', s', t', c')$", "MATH_0026": "$X'$", "MATH_0027": "$j$", "MATH_0028": "$G/B$", "MATH_0029": "$U$", "MATH_0030": "$j'$", "MATH_0031": "$G$", "MATH_0032": "$U'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-groupoids-lemma-base-change-groupoid}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-groupoids-lemma-groupoid-from-action}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0008": "\\item", "STRUCT_0009": "\\item", "STRUCT_0010": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0011": "\\item", "STRUCT_0012": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-on-invariant}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:57d47b10f3c36bc7c6ee49f11ff633610ef49f9ba65ef0817daf2e2746a42bbe", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f166475ad9e7f1807a076e3f379f2501807f6250dab07c1a18b78140ba035d41", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme, and let <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a pre-relation of algebraic\nspaces over <MATH_0005>. Let <MATH_0006> be an <MATH_0007>-invariant morphism of algebraic\nspaces over <MATH_0008>. Let <MATH_0009> be any morphism of algebraic spaces.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Setting <MATH_0010>, <MATH_0011> we obtain\na pre-relation <MATH_0012>.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0013> is a relation, then <MATH_0014> is a relation.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0015> is a pre-equivalence relation, then <MATH_0016> is a\npre-equivalence relation.\n<STRUCT_0005> If <MATH_0017> is an equivalence relation, then <MATH_0018> is an equivalence\nrelation.\n<STRUCT_0006> If <MATH_0019> comes from a groupoid in algebraic spaces\n<MATH_0020> over <MATH_0021>, then\n<STRUCT_0007>\n<STRUCT_0008> <MATH_0022> is a groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0023>, and\n<STRUCT_0009> <MATH_0024> comes from the base change <MATH_0025>\nof this groupoid to <MATH_0026>, see\nGroupoids in Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0010>\n<STRUCT_0011> If <MATH_0027> comes from the action of a group algebraic space <MATH_0028> on <MATH_0029>\nas in Groupoids in Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0002>\nthen <MATH_0030> comes from the induced action of <MATH_0031> on <MATH_0032>.\n<STRUCT_0012>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5258fafa897f17e257c452035b9d1bed77276e874cf667d17801a16c8074be20", "unit_id": "tag:048G:statement"}
